 "remarks": "Elegant interiors, a stunning new kitchen, and expansive grounds distinguish this inviting ranch in desirable West Norwalk. Set on a generous corner lot, 9 Cornwall Road offers effortless one-level living with thoughtfully designed spaces for everyday comfort and sophisticated entertaining. Hardwood floors flow throughout the main level, where the spacious living room is anchored by a welcoming fireplace. The newly renovated kitchen features an impressive new center island, quartz countertops, stylish cabinetry, and brand-new GE Profile appliances. An adjacent family room provides an inviting setting to relax and gather. Step directly from the gorgeous kitchen onto the new upper deck for morning coffee, alfresco dining, or unwinding with a glass of wine at the end of your day. Stairs connect the upper deck to a generous 20-by-20-foot lower deck, creating the ultimate entertaining experience. The three-bedroom layout includes a primary bedroom with an en-suite bathroom and two additional bedrooms. The lower level features an attached garage and a dedicated laundry area with a new washing machine. The spacious basement presents exciting possibilities for future finished living space-envision a media lounge, home gym, private office, or recreation room tailored to your lifestyle-or enjoy its abundant storage. Outside, new fencing complements the generous grounds. Centrally located near shops and dining.",
